+### Frame generation in `libvulkan.prx`
+
+A package built with a ps5-framegen checkout links into `libvulkan.prx`
+[ps5-framegen](https://github.com/Swordpdf/ps5-framegen) (© 2026 swordpdf),
+its frame interpolator, under the GNU General Public License version 3 or
+later (`LICENSES/ps5-framegen/COPYING`). Its shaders, compiled into it, are
+AMD FidelityFX SDK 2.3.0's FSR3 optical flow, some modified by its author,
+under the MIT licence (`LICENSES/ps5-framegen/shaders-LICENSE.txt`, which
+names the files and gives AMD's notice). `SOURCES.txt` names the commit.
+Like the RADV driver it is linked with, `libvulkan.prx` is then a GPL-3.0
+work as a whole.
+
 ## OpenGL: Mesa WGL/Zink, `win/mesa-zink/`
 
 OpenGL games draw through Mesa's Windows WGL frontend and its Zink driver,
